WEBVTT

00:24:29.659 --> 00:24:35.880
It's really, put yourself
into different experiences

00:24:35.904 --> 00:24:40.869
that are creative and see
where that takes you.

00:24:43.436 --> 00:24:46.931
AG: You may not aspire to quit your job
and become an Instagram star,

00:24:46.955 --> 00:24:48.607
or to switch fields at all.

00:24:48.631 --> 00:24:50.090
And you don't have to.

00:24:50.560 --> 00:24:52.237
There are ways to reach new heights

00:24:52.261 --> 00:24:54.276
while staying within your career path.

00:24:54.300 --> 00:24:57.609
Think about whether
you're a sprinter or a marathoner,

00:24:57.633 --> 00:24:58.847
not in terms of running,

00:24:58.871 --> 00:25:02.101
but how you go about
generating creative ideas.